@startuml
title ATM Control - Withdrawal Transaction

[*] --> State

state "Waiting for User Input" as WaitingForInput
state "Processing Withdrawal" as ProcessingWithdrawal {
  state "Validating PIN" as ValidatingPIN
  state "Checking Balance" as CheckingBalance
}
state "Dispensing Cash" as DispensingCash
state "Printing Receipt" as PrintingReceipt
state "Ejecting Card" as EjectingCard

WaitingForInput --> ValidatingPIN : User Inserts Card /\nGet PIN
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForInput : Invalid PIN / Display Error Message
ValidatingPIN --> CheckingBalance : Valid PIN / Check Balance
CheckingBalance --> ProcessingWithdrawal : Sufficient Funds / Process Withdrawal
ProcessingWithdrawal --> DispensingCash : Approved / Dispense Cash
DispensingCash --> PrintingReceipt : Cash Dispensed /\nPrint Receipt,\nDisplay Cash Dispensed,\nConfirm Cash Dispensed
PrintingReceipt --> EjectingCard : Receipt Printed /\nEject Card

WaitingForInput --> EjectingCard : Cancel / Eject Card

state "Terminating Transaction" as TerminatingTransaction {
  state Terminating
  state Confiscating
}

Confiscating --> Terminating : Card Confiscated /\nDisplay Confiscated
EjectingCard --> Terminating : Card Ejected /\nDisplay Ejected

Terminating --> WaitingForInput : After (Elapsed Time) [Closedown Not Requested]

@enduml
